#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Summary {#summary}"
msgstr "Summary {#summary}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In summary, we calculated the average expectation values of weight-1 and weight-2 Z-types observables for a periodic 1D chain of 109 qubits. In order to do so, we\n"
msgstr "Sa buod, kinalkula natin ang average na expectation values ng weight-1 at weight-2 Z-types observables para sa isang periodic 1D chain ng 109 qubits. Upang magawa ito, ating\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "created a virtual coupling map by adding a long range connectivity between the first and the last qubits of the 1D chain, and transpiled the circuit.\n"
msgstr "lumikha ng virtual coupling map sa pamamagitan ng pagdagdag ng long range connectivity sa pagitan ng una at ng huling mga qubit ng 1D chain, at i-transpile ang circuit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "transpilation at this stage allowed us to avoid the overhead of transpiling each subexperiment separately after cutting,\n"
msgstr "ang transpilation sa yugtong ito ay nagpahintulot sa atin na maiwasan ang overhead ng pag-transpile ng bawat subexperiment nang hiwalay pagkatapos ng pagputol,\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "using virtual coupling map allowed us to avoid extra SWAP gates for the 2-qubit operation between the first and the last qubits.\n"
msgstr "ang paggamit ng virtual coupling map ay nagpahintulot sa atin na maiwasan ang extra SWAP gates para sa 2-qubit operation sa pagitan ng una at ng huling mga qubit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "removed the long range connectivity from the transpiled circuit via gate cutting.\n"
msgstr "tinanggal ang long range connectivity mula sa transpiled circuit sa pamamagitan ng gate cutting.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "converted the cut circuits into basis gate set by applying appropriate transpilation passes.\n"
msgstr "na-convert ang mga cut circuits sa basis gate set sa pamamagitan ng paglalapat ng naaangkop na transpilation passes.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "executed the cut circuits on IBM Quantum device using a `SamplerV2` primitive.\n"
msgstr "na-execute ang mga cut circuits sa IBM Quantum device gamit ang `SamplerV2` primitive.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "obtained the expectation value by reconstructing the outcomes of the cut circuits.\n"
msgstr "nakuha ang expectation value sa pamamagitan ng pag-reconstruct ng mga kinalabasan ng mga cut circuits.\n"

